				""
				"The TARDIS can go &e&lAnywhere and Anytime&r... within reason."
				""
				"&7- The TARDIS cannot travel to the End if an Ender Dragon is still alive."
				"&7- The TARDIS cannot exceed the world’s boundaries, neither above nor below."
				"&7- The TARDIS cannot land on the Nether roof."
				""
